### Lab 03: Path & Query Parameters, Search & Pagination
### Tested with VS Code REST Client

### 1. Search books by query parameter (e.g. search_q=Harry)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/?search_q=Harry
Accept: application/json

### 2. Search, Sort and Paginate (limit=2, offset=0, order_by=price, order=DESC)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/?order_by=price&order=DESC&limit=2&offset=0
Accept: application/json

### 3. Filter books by price range (min_price=300 & max_price=500)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/filter?min_price=300&max_price=500
Accept: application/json

### 4. Database Aggregate Statistics
GET http://localhost:3000/books/stats/summary
Accept: application/json

### 5. Fetch books by author path parameter
GET http://localhost:3000/books/author/Tolkien/
Accept: application/json
